---
/**
 * The three blurred colour streaks behind the hero (Pencil: `Atmospheric Light
 * Streak`). All geometry lives in `.streak-1/2/3` in global.css — see the note
 * there about the Pencil→CSS rotation flip and about keeping `style`
 * attributes out of the markup for the CSP.
 */
---

<div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 overflow-hidden">
  <span class="streak streak-1"></span>
  <span class="streak streak-2"></span>
  <span class="streak streak-3"></span>
</div>
